 don\u2019t overdo it - a lost customer might never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/extras/5c72044d1665ac39461900b8158f814d.poster.avif?t=1764595360\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/extras/5c72044d1665ac39461900b8158f814d.webm?t=1764595360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/extras/5c72044d1665ac39461900b8158f814d.mp4?t=1764595360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Do-It-Yourself </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpack goods, stack the shelves and organize your storage space. Work the cash register and make sure that the customer gets the best service possible. Or hire helpers to help with the daily business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expand your store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More is definitely more. Satisfied customers bring more business and a demand for more varied goods. So expand your property or build a second floor to display everything you have to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/extras/eeb78851c18328c05414adae56a80b30.poster.avif?t=1764595360\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/extras/eeb78851c18328c05414adae56a80b30.webm?t=1764595360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic