l is your house, just waiting to be personalized and decorated.</p>","developers":["SunDust"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690760/5ae8186ca7c9f77fcc85fe9ea1e08ca6e6c9e0d4/header.jpg?t=1764595360","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Wild West Supermarket Simulator \u00a92025 Toplitz Productions GmbH. Published by SunDust. SunDust is a label of Toplitz Productions.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690760/1566443753/c177717028f9799955a64082fd8c193116416b11/1762360082/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762360585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690760/1566443753/c177717028f9799955a64082fd8c193116416b11/1762360082/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762360585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690760/1566443753/c177717028f9799955a64082fd8c193116416b11/1762360082/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762360585","id":257227228,"name":"October Update EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227228/b1d5980b4c7233c38c402aa3c61ecb7c9552cab4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762360585"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690760/1531289349/90aac8d2672eab08468e5186a9c5751eea04551a/1759398705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759406331","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690760/1531289349/90aac8d2672eab08468e5186a9c5751eea04551a/1759398705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759406331","hi